WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:01.547
- And work with your wife on

00:00:01.547 --> 00:00:02.590
"It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia".

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:03.423
So how is that?

00:00:03.423 --> 00:00:05.160
Is that good to work?

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:05.993
- I mean,

00:00:05.993 --> 00:00:07.870
I feel a certain amount of pressure that

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:09.500
what if we're in the writer's room

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.690
and no story lines have
popped up for her character.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.163
I'm like, I can't go
home and tell her this.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:15.910
- Yeah, she'd be like, "What's up?"

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.840
- But it's also a blast,
although she's very mean

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:18.773
to me on the show.

00:00:19.899 --> 00:00:21.820
- So she can get out any
frustration she might have

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:22.730
at home on camera.

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.151
- She seems to really enjoy it.

00:00:24.151 --> 00:00:24.984
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:24.984 --> 00:00:25.817
Really enjoy it.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:26.690
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:28.410
- I think that's also healthy, you know?

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.520
She gets to act out her frustrations.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:31.660
- Yeah, I like it.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.920
So wait, so did did she play your sister

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.520
at some point in something?

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.664
- [Charlie Day] Yes.

00:00:36.664 --> 00:00:37.981
- [Kelly] And was that awkward?

00:00:37.981 --> 00:00:38.814
(audience laughs)

00:00:38.814 --> 00:00:41.680
- Well, we auditioned together

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.440
for an episode of "Reno 911",

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.730
and they used to do improv auditions

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.630
and so Mary Liz and I
went into the audition

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:52.270
and told them that we
were brother and sister

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.787
and then we started
making out in the audition

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:59.120
and they were like, ""Oh my
God, we have to cast them."

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.650
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.512
- They like used the storyline?

00:01:03.512 --> 00:01:04.345
(audience clapping)
- Yeah.

00:01:04.345 --> 00:01:05.748
- That's amazing.

00:01:05.748 --> 00:01:07.760
Oh my, that could have gone either way.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:08.593
- Yeah, absolutely.

00:01:08.593 --> 00:01:09.970
- [Kelly] It was a gamble.

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:12.410
- Could have called a
service (indistinct) us.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:13.760
- Oh my gosh, get them out.

